:: Meal More Time Needed [activity meal] {"position":"1225,2225"}
/*
{
        id: "more_time_needed",
        passage: "Meal More Time Needed",
        isActive: false,
        mealType: ["dinner"],
        isImportant: true,
        dayType: ["weekday", "weekend"],
        cooldown: 0,
        once: true,
        lastSeen: -1,
        present: ["mom", "sister"],
        requirements: [
        ],
        set: [
            () => setup.getMealById("more_time_needed").isActive = false,
        ]
}
   Activated by: "More Time Needed" (main_moreTimeNeeded). $sister.callName did my chores,
   I signed the note on the fridge, and now $mom.callName has seen the kitchen.
*/
The note is still on the fridge when I come down for dinner. Somebody has stuck a second magnet on it, the strawberry one, which in this house is the equivalent of a framed certificate.

/* IMAGE: images/meals/important/more_time_needed.jpg | Close-up of the fridge: a handwritten checklist with four checkmarks held up by a strawberry magnet. Sister in the background, arms crossed, glaring. */

$mom.callName is in a ridiculously good mood. She made chicken, the one with the lemon that takes forever, and she keeps touching my shoulder every time she walks past my chair.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $mom, text: "I came home, and I honestly thought I'd walked into the wrong house. The counters! The recycling was out! Somebody vacuumed under the couch, $player.name. Under it." },
{ who: $player, text: "It was nothing." },
{ who: $sister, text: "Yeah. It was nothing." },
{ text: "Something connects with my shin under the table. Hard." },
{ who: $mom, text: "It wasn't nothing. I know how busy you are with your project. And you still found the time." },
{ who: $sister, text: "Amazing how he found the time. Truly inspiring. Did you notice the vacuum lines, $mom.callName? They go diagonal. That's a very specific technique." },
{ who: $mom, text: "I did notice! It looked so neat." },
{ who: $sister, text: "Mm. Funny. That's exactly how I do it." },
{ who: $player, text: "I learned from the best." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

$sister.callName stabs a piece of chicken with real feeling and chews it while staring at me. I give her the smallest possible smile. She mouths something across the table that $mom.callName, mercifully, doesn't see.

Over dessert $mom.callName slides a folded twenty under my plate, the way she used to with lunch money, and tells me not to argue. I don't argue. When I look up, $sister.callName is shaking her head very slowly. Then, despite herself, she snorts into her ice cream.

She's annoyed. She's also still not saying anything, and she did it all again this afternoon without being asked.

<<UpdateStat "+" "MomRelation" 2>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "Money" 20>>
